{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo version will give you an explosive look into what Explosive Odds is all about!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Players.gif?t=1748979863\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be the last bot sitting in head to head matches with 2-4 players.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience tense PvP matches with 2, 3 or 4 players. Start each round by picking a wire and setting a detonator. If another player triggers your detonator you'll get bonus cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Money.gif?t=1748979863\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clear wires to get cash, the richest player at the end of the 3 rounds wins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The BombSlot device houses 4 wheels with 8 wires each. On your turn choose one of the three wheels to cut its front facing wire. Cutting a wire can earn you cash, abilities or, if your unlucky, detonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Abilities.gif?t=1748979863\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use  abilities to gain an edge over chance.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scan</strong> - to narrow down which wires may be detonators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spin</strong>\u00a0- each wheel to a new random position (and maybe earn some bonus cash).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skip</strong> - your turn, sometimes its best to let another player cut a suspicious looking wire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reverse</strong> -  the turn order and send it right back to the previous bot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lock</strong> - to limit another players choice to just one wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo offers a variety of abilities, but even more will be available in the full game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Boom.gif?t=1748979863\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778760?t=1748979863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/8779bf37df8a430dc53b42962e1308d32d982d25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748979863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/7f8bd1b59bf6cb9e53d24d9f9f785cd01f84a926/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748979863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/7f8bd1b59bf6cb9e53d24d9f9f785cd01f84a926/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748979863","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Coming in the Full Version!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EO_DemoFullVersionAd.png?t=1748979863\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo version will give you an explosive look into what Explosive Odds is all about!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778760/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Players.gif?t=1748979863\" /></p><h2 cl